# Caddy terminates TLS (auto Let's Encrypt cert via HTTP-01) on your DuckDNS
# hostname and reverse-proxies the WebSocket upgrade straight through to the
# Node Battleground server on localhost:8080. Nothing else needs to change —
# reverse_proxy forwards the Connection:Upgrade handshake transparently.
#
# Replace yourname.duckdns.org with your actual DuckDNS (or real domain) name.
yourname.duckdns.org {
	reverse_proxy localhost:8080
}
